\f0\fs24 \cf0 # \uc0\u55358 \u56778  Antarctic AI Navigation & Iceberg Trajectory Prediction System\
\
An end-to-end AI-powered navigation system built for the Smart India Hackathon (SIH). The platform leverages deep learning (GRU/LSTM) on historical satellite tracking data to predict iceberg trajectories, generates dynamic collision risk maps, and uses A* pathfinding for safe maritime routing.\
\
---\
\
## \uc0\u55357 \u56524  Features\
\
* **Data Processing:** Automated ingestion, cleaning, and feature engineering for the [BYU/NIC Antarctic Iceberg Tracking Database](https://scp.byu.edu/).\
* **Trajectory Prediction:** Sequence-to-sequence GRU/LSTM model to predict 24h/48h iceberg coordinates.\
* **Baseline Benchmarking:** Comparative analysis against Constant Velocity baseline models using Haversine distance error.\
* **Risk Engine & Route Optimization:** Dynamic risk grid generation and A* algorithm for fuel- and safety-optimized vessel pathing.\
* **Interactive Dashboard:** Dynamic React + FastAPI map UI with live simulation and dynamic replanning.\
\
